tips.description:
Common factors affecting Mage Warrior's double power:
1. Physical and magic damage bonuses from items;
2. Mage trait provides 10% magic damage bonus; Rengar's rival trait provides physical damage bonus;
3. Hold the Line, Coronation, Cybernetic Implants, Focused Fire augments provide different physical and magic damage bonuses;
4. Accessory and device series sprites provide physical or magic damage bonus consumables

